<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-ZEMES BANK LENDS 3 MLN MARKS TO POST OFFICE.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-ZEMES BANK LENDS 3 MLN MARKS TO POST OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zemes Bank said on Thursday that it was awarded the contract to lend three million marks to the Latvian post office.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the loan was offered at a low rate of interest but did not say what it was. It said the interest rate would be reviewed twice a year.</p>
<p>It said the loan would be used to improve the post office's technical base.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
